            '<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-xl" style="background:hsl(var(--hero-accent)/0.12);color:hsl(var(--hero-accent));">🖥️</div>' +
            '<h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-2">ICT Services & Digital Transformation</h3>' +
            '<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-3">Enterprise ICT advisory, managed-service rollouts, automation and workforce-solution platforms for transformation programmes.</p>' +
